{"c":[{"name":"20261003T124605Z-cfb4c770396b2ce0","text":"Snipaste keeps a layer-25 alpha-1 window around the main display; SurfaceGate skips elevated windows containing a whole display, or every offer is held as covered (A10).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T124605Z-ed64edafa04a21d4","text":"KeyType estimates a single-line field's caret flush with the field's bottom edge once it holds text; fit checks must not add height below the caret (A10 cd92606).","type":"note"}]}
